e","speaker":"Player","text":"That's pretty good.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's pretty good.","TextSheVersion":"That's pretty good.","TextTheyVersion":"That's pretty good."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43977","byteOffset":30971584,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_BE9026A6","articyId":"72057606922872968","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Thanks to Clancy we collected 4467 Lims this week, plus what we collected in person. I'm sure we could have doubled that with Reena's help.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks to Clancy we collected 4467 Lims this week, plus what we collected in person. I'm sure we could have doubled that with Reena's help.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25213","byteOffset":17421080,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_62FB78E8","articyId":"72057606922872980","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Alright, I'll speak to her.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright, I'll speak to her.","TextSheVersion":"Alright, I'll speak to her.","TextTheyVersion":"Alright, I'll speak to her."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16770","byteOffset":14238360,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_73B7442D","articyId":"72057606922872998","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"You're right, we need to move faster. I'll speak to them.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're right, we need to move faster. I'll speak to them.","TextSheVersion":"You're right, we need to move faster. I'll speak to them.","TextTheyVersion":"You're right, we need to move faster. I'll speak to them."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36097","byteOffset":28003280,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_F87E01D4","articyId":"72057606922873012","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Unfortunately, I believe Reena now has a new client and is unavailable.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Unfortunately, I believe Reena now has a new client and is unavailable.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3425.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52313","byteOffset":34205328,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_8F0F42CB","articyId":"72057606922873026","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"And I took the liberty of adding a few more potential donors to the list.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And I took the liberty of adding a few more potential donors to the list.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5075.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23541","byteOffset":16784480,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_518FBFEF","articyId":"72057606922873037","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"With Reena's help we collected 2978 Lims this week, plus a few direct donations. I really do think Clancy could help give things a boost.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"With Reena's help we collected 2978 Lims this week, plus a few direct donations. I really do think Clancy could help give things a boost.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46538","byteOffset":31939192,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_8099D4DA","articyId":"72057606922873043","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"We collected 1489 Lims, plus the few you made directly. It's not much; we need Clancy and Reena's help to spread the word.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We collected 1489 Lims, plus the few you made directly. It's not much; we need Clancy and Reena's help to spread the word.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":875.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27708","byteOffset":18363976,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_39CFCD24","articyId":"72057606922873049","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"OK, I'll speak to him.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"OK, I'll speak to him.","TextSheVersion":"OK, I'll speak to him.","TextTheyVersion":"OK, I'll speak to him."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32884","byteOffset":20324960,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_D6FF5189","articyId":"72057606922881909","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"It is, but we are still a long way off. Perhaps next week will pick up. I've sent the current balance to your HUD.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It is, but we are still a long way off. Perhaps next week will pick up. I've sent the current balance to your HUD.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4375.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19657","byteOffset":15320360,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_730BD73E","articyId":"72057606922881915","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Please do so quickly. In the meantime, I have sent the current balance to your HUD. You can do this.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please do so quickly. In the meantime, I have sent the current balance to your HUD. You can do this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4375.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24022","byteOffset":16967176,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_19A7D03E","articyId":"72057606922881921","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Good, we need him. In the meantime, I have sent the current balance to your HUD.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good, we need him. In the meantime, I have sent the current balance to your HUD.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4375.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31426","byteOffset":19770416,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_B384EFAA","articyId":"72057606922881927","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"We'll have to think of something else. We don't have long. In the meantime, I've sent the current balance to your HUD.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"lo